in our lesson so far we got a basic  understanding of RNA seek now let's  conduct a simplified version of the RNA  seek using the TBI info platform note  that in this demo pipeline you are  making use of samples that were taken  from humanized mice with implanted  tumors and it consists of two breast  cancer subtypes that is estrogen  receptor positive and triple negative  our aim here is to generate gene  expression tables from the raw RNA  Secrets now let us click on start to  begin the pipeline  note that the functions of each of the  algorithms have been explained in the  pop-ups that show when you click on that  particular step so feel free to browse  through and learn at your own pace  recall that RNA seek analysis consists  of three major steps first we have the  pre-processing steps that makes use of  trimomatic  and PCR clean  then we have the bow tie2t algorithm for  mapping on the transcripts  and arson expression table for  quantifying Gene and isoform abundances  click on end to end the pipeline  with that we have built our very first  rnac pipeline using breast cancer  samples in our next video we will  discuss what are the various outputs and  how to interpret them
 

